{"id":"623edb148c120615","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-supercompact-cardinal.md","title":"Supercompact Cardinal","display":"df-supercompact-cardinal — Supercompact Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-supercompact-cardinal","aliases":["58-df-supercompact-cardinal"],"display":"df-supercompact-cardinal — Supercompact Cardinal","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-card7-supercompactness-measure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-supercompact-cardinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-supercompact-cardinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-supercompact-cardinal — Supercompact Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f2438fc1d12482c4\" href=\"?note=f2438fc1d12482c4\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-card7-supercompactness-measure.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-card7-supercompactness-measure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda,U\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda,U\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCard7SupercompactnessMeasure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCard7SupercompactnessMeasure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f2438fc1d12482c4\" href=\"?note=f2438fc1d12482c4\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-card7-supercompactness-measure.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-card7-supercompactness-measure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Supercompact}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Supercompact}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (本文件定义)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supercompact\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\operatorname{Supercompact}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa\\leq\\lambda)\\to\\exists U\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcCard7SupercompactnessMeasure}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda,U)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supercompact\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\operatorname{Supercompact}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa\\leq\\lambda)\\to\\exists U\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcCard7SupercompactnessMeasure}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda,U)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The upstream measure predicate expands ultrafilterhood, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-completeness, fineness, and normality on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_\\kappa(\\lambda)\">\\(\\mathcal P_\\kappa(\\lambda)\\)</span>; omitting normality would not characterize supercompactness.</li>\n<li>They are stronger than measurable cardinals.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-card7-supercompactness-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"f2438fc1d12482c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-card7-supercompactness-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-card7-supercompactness-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"f2438fc1d12482c4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcCard7SupercompactnessMeasure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch05/58-df-zfc-card7-supercompactness-measure.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda,U\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCard7SupercompactnessMeasure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Supercompact}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supercompact\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\operatorname{Supercompact}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega<\\kappa\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa\\leq\\lambda)\\to\\exists U\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcCard7SupercompactnessMeasure}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda,U)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_\\kappa(\\lambda)","display":false}],"bytes":1314,"backlinks":[{"id":"a15944d89f213496","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"This theorem gives the class-embedding characterization of the ultrafilter definition in [[../batch18/58-df-supercompact-cardinal.md]]."},{"id":"b3eb7df177180e9d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Supercompact}$ (supercompact-cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-supercompact-cardinal]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1262","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-supercompact-cardinal.md|58-df-supercompact-cardinal]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["5fb1c2241d1943d1","f2438fc1d12482c4"]}